  "body": "This change implements the \"Future Deep\" design language across the PulseLink suite. It updates the Android theme definitions, RingerSong colors, and completely overhauls the Web client's CSS and component structure. Key improvements include a unified dark aesthetic with glassmorphism, optimized list rendering in React, and fixes for contrast issues on the login screen. The Web client's thread list rendering was refactored to ensure performance by restoring memoization logic.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [268827495029378179](https://jules.google.com/task/268827495029378179) started by @DamienLove*",
